@startuml
title Class Diagram SIPRAJA — As-Built 21 September 2026
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class User {
  role: admin | super_admin
  status
}
class GuestAccess {
  token_hash
  expires_at
}
class Report {
  code
  type: lapor
  reporter_nik: nullable legacy
  status
  location
  feedback
}
class ReportStatusHistory
class Attachment
class ActivityTemplate
class Activity {
  type: internal | external
  category
  location
  handling_result
  evaluation
}
class ActivityFinding
class Officer {
  employee_number
  position
  work_unit_name
  unit_name
  status
}
class Archive
class ArchiveFile
class AuditLog

class PelaporController
class AdminReportController
class ReportStatusController
class CompleteReportController
class ActivityController
class AiAssistantController
class GeminiAssistant <<service>>

GuestAccess "1" -- "0..*" Report
User "0..1" -- "0..*" Report : created by
Report "1" -- "0..*" ReportStatusHistory
Report "1" -- "0..1" Activity : completion
Report "1" .. "0..*" Attachment : polymorphic
ActivityTemplate "0..1" -- "0..*" Activity
User "1" -- "0..*" Activity : creator/evaluator
Activity "0..*" -- "0..*" Officer
Activity "1" -- "0..*" ActivityFinding
Activity "1" .. "0..*" Attachment : polymorphic
Archive "1" -- "1..*" ArchiveFile
User "0..1" -- "0..*" AuditLog : actor

PelaporController ..> Report
AdminReportController ..> Report
ReportStatusController ..> Report
CompleteReportController ..> Report
CompleteReportController ..> Activity
ActivityController ..> Activity
AiAssistantController ..> GeminiAssistant

note bottom
  Dihapus dari sistem aktif:
  - Darurat dan Informasi & Pengaduan
  - input NIK publik
  - OrganizationalUnit dan OperationalZone
  - Asset serta peringatan kendaraan
end note
@enduml
